# Auto commit / push

When you change helm-trader source in this repo:

1. Update `README.md` if user-facing behavior changed.
2. `git add` the changed source (not secrets).
3. Create a commit, then `git push` to the tracked remote.

Never commit `.env`, credentials, `data/`, `.venv`, `node_modules`, or `web/dist`.
Never force-push. Never change git config. Never skip hooks.
